<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/logo.jpg">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Return & Exchange - New Heels</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background: #F8F3EF; }
        .page-header { padding: 60px 0 30px; text-align: center; }
        .page-header h1 { color: #3F3040; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .page-header p { color: #8B6688; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .policy-card { background: white; padding: 50px; border-top: 4px solid #C9A45C; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 60px; box-shadow: 0 5px 30px rgba(63, 48, 64, 0.05); }
        .policy-card h3 { color: #3F3040; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F8F3EF; }
        .policy-card h3:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
        .policy-card p, .policy-card li { color: #5a4a5c; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .policy-card ul, .policy-card ol { padding-left: 20px; }
        .policy-card strong { color: #8B6688; }
        .highlight-box { background: #F8F3EF; padding: 20px; border-left: 4px solid #C9A45C; margin: 20px 0; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .policy-card { padding: 30px 20px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Return & Exchange</h1>
            <p>Our Customer Promise</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="policy-card">
            <div class="highlight-box">
                <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>7-Day Return Policy:</strong> You can return or exchange any product within 7 days of delivery if it meets our return conditions.</p>
            </div>

            <h3>Return Period</h3>
            <p>Returns and exchanges are accepted within <strong>7 days</strong> of receiving your order.</p>

            <h3>Eligible for Return</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Product is unused, unworn, and in original condition</li>
                <li>Original packaging and tags are intact</li>
                <li>Product is not damaged or altered</li>
                <li>Valid order number and receipt</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Non-Returnable Items</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Sale or discounted items (final sale)</li>
                <li>Customized or personalized products</li>
                <li>Products damaged due to misuse</li>
                <li>Items returned after 7 days</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Exchange Process</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Contact us via WhatsApp or email with your order number</li>
                <li>Our team will confirm the exchange eligibility</li>
                <li>Ship the product back to our address</li>
                <li>Once received and inspected, we'll ship the exchanged item</li>
            </ol>

            <h3>Refund Policy</h3>
            <p>Refunds are processed within <strong>5-7 business days</strong> after we receive and inspect the returned product. Refunds are issued via:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Bank Transfer</li>
                <li>JazzCash / EasyPaisa</li>
                <li>Store Credit (optional)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Shipping Cost for Returns</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Defective/Wrong Product:</strong> We cover return shipping</li>
                <li><strong>Change of Mind:</strong> Customer covers return shipping</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Contact Us</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> 0327 7985292</li>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> newheelsmardan@gmail.com</li>
                <li><strong>Hours:</strong> Mon-Sat, 10 AM - 10 PM</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>